@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor black
}
left to right direction

' Exact Route Components & Modals in warptalk-web
rectangle "Join Meeting Page" as JoinMeetingPage
rectangle "Workspace Join Request Page" as WorkspaceJoinPage
rectangle "Login Page" as LoginPage
rectangle "Room Information Page" as RoomInformationPage
rectangle "Room Setup Modal" as RoomSetupModal
rectangle "Waiting Room Page" as WaitingRoomPage
rectangle "Active Meeting Room Page" as ActiveMeetingRoomPage

' 1. Unauthenticated Guest Room Link Access & Preflight Redirect
JoinMeetingPage --> WorkspaceJoinPage

' 2. Authentication & Workspace Access Resolution Sub-Flows
WorkspaceJoinPage --> LoginPage
LoginPage --> WorkspaceJoinPage
WorkspaceJoinPage --> RoomInformationPage

' 3. Authenticated External Member Flow
JoinMeetingPage --> RoomInformationPage

' 4. Pre-meeting Setup & Details
RoomInformationPage --> RoomSetupModal

' 5. Waiting Room Lobby & Final Entry to Active Meeting
RoomInformationPage --> WaitingRoomPage
WaitingRoomPage --> ActiveMeetingRoomPage

RoomSetupModal --> ActiveMeetingRoomPage
JoinMeetingPage --> ActiveMeetingRoomPage

@enduml
